            <ArticleTitle>Coronary heart disease in HIV-infected persons.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>S15-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Treatment of HIV-infected patients with HAART has prolonged survival, and clinicians must now be concerned with chronic diseases, some of which may be more prevalent in this population. This article focuses on coronary heart disease in persons with HIV infection.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
